#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:3
#: 4d6beee92574476980b888e7859b55a6
msgid "原子扰动（Atomic Perturb）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:5
#: bb38bfa3c3a543fc942a412b5f350052
msgid "`Group`: `Perturbation` | `Class`: `PerturbCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:7
#: cbc4d2ff5ef0479aad7727fdcee75684
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:9
#: 13612b5b94f74c63ba2a40f7a51e3c66
msgid "对原子坐标施加随机位移扰动，补充近平衡势能面的局部位移样本。每个原子的随机位移向量长度不超过 `max_distance`，晶格保持不变。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:11
#: e118956562e642e8949c52586bf1c79d
msgid ""
"\\Delta\\mathbf{r}_i=r_i\\hat{\\mathbf{u}}_i,\\quad 0\\le r_i\\le "
"d_i,\\quad \\|\\hat{\\mathbf{u}}_i\\|=1,\\quad "
"\\mathbf{r}_i'=\\mathbf{r}_i+\\Delta\\mathbf{r}_i"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:13
#: 6c6415660cf347c98b88d1b9f17f8fe6
msgid "开启 `identify_organic` 后有机分子团簇做刚性整体移动，避免分子内键被拉伸。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:15
#: 419845a35eae4367ac00996c2df08522
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:17
#: 4a89340b0ea342539a52a5705dfa2bf4
msgid "场景：静力学测试集上力 MAE 只有 50 meV/A，但 MD 轨迹上跳到 200 meV/A"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:19
#: 01ef1af08e104a8b97164f02f8f45ff3
msgid ""
"你在 Si 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，用 DFT 静态计算的数据做验证，力的 MAE 只有 50 meV/A。但用这个模型跑 300K NVT "
"MD 时，力的误差跳到了 200 meV/A——因为训练集里所有原子都在平衡位置，模型没见过原子偏离平衡态的构型。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:21
#: b00809a2dffe40839fef77df6968d959
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 静态弛豫结构代表势能面极小点。MD "
"轨迹在极小点周围的势能面上采样，模型需要对平衡位置附近的位移方向有力学响应。如果训练集全是极小点，模型对偏离平衡的力梯度完全是外推的。解决方法是对每个结构的原子做随机小位移，让模型学习近平衡势能面的曲率。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:23
#: e04d65a0011a48f895a223e3f9f52b2a
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 Si 超胞（64 原子）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:25
#: dee7cec1782c4d659d4fc3f137caf983
msgid "**目标：** 生成 50 个扰动版本，每个原子的位移幅度 ≤ 0.15 Å（约室温 Si 振动幅度的 2~3 倍）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:27
#: cad80e78351e4b42bd1d3726b9031d34
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:28
#: 2d61aa4b5d8542cf92c7c65ea24f012c
msgid "`max_distance` = `0.15` （单位 Å）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:29
#: ef92687fb2c7408392c79760ec392854
msgid "`max_num` = `50`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:30
#: 7fb32ab47a9446a292f88ec026ee2229
msgid "`engine_type` = `0` （Sobol，少量样本覆盖更均匀）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:32
#: dda0886a192f41ff880f0a73bfcf4048
msgid "**输出：** 50 个结构，每个原子的坐标在原始位置附近随机偏移 0~0.15 Å"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:34
#: f16e3ea5ba4e462388456233b1ed0e49
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:35
#: 46d11ed8d45145a591c282a23609c9ac
msgid "重训后用一段 MD 轨迹做推理，力的 MAE 应该显著下降，接近静力学测试集水平"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:36
#: 526d3c04c62f430c900912971bce9616
msgid ""
"抽查最短键长：0.15 Å 位移下 Si-Si 键长变化应在 ±0.3 Å 以内（两个相邻原子可能向不同方向偏移）。如果出现 < 1.8 Å "
"的短键，降低 `max_distance`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:37
#: 04f43428940f46498125a818280ff178
msgid "如果改善不够，增大 `max_num` 到 100、也增大 `max_distance` 到 0.25 Å"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:38
#: 293ac7d0a76b4cf2995d77e72f1196d1
msgid "如果体系含多种元素且质量差异大（如含 H + 重元素），考虑开启 `use_element_scaling` 给轻元素更大位移"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:40
#: 629ca796264b401a9409060e5464b3ab
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:42
#: de9bfe4bc1a74c3ea48fbba299897546
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:43
#: 7162da50a1e64f98876a198d204ffb72
msgid "训练集主要由静态弛豫结构组成，缺少力方向信息"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:44
#: 7bf80ac430934dfc93572ddef4ee9ac3
msgid "模型在 MD 模拟或非平衡构型上力预测偏差大"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:45
#: 4b33ee01a8f44135b49b37aaa1beddf5
msgid "需要补近平衡势能面的曲率（力常数）信息"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:47
#: 63f142d18403483e9872cd1902338339
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:48
#: 9be873b02b13447e9400a05ef1706b3f
msgid "训练集已有大量 MD 轨迹数据——MD 本身已覆盖热振动位移，再加随机扰动是冗余的"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:49
#: f4e03b6de2c24b1e9147f2d96e475d93
msgid "输入结构未弛豫——扰动一个本身就不在极小点的结构没有意义，先弛豫再扰动"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:50
#: a3bde5a08f284cb7b373f2f46a753579
msgid "位移幅度设置的过大（> 0.5 Å），产生大量非物理构型——这种大位移应该用 MD 而不是随机扰动"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:52
#: 3dc8db2ebaf64fed931f6266023c6ef5
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:54
#: d18bd5007b7c43a0a99f257ad0b52f14
msgid "Engine Type（engine_type）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:56
#: 8a529035ecef4f599a4fb8e9dc81dff6
msgid "`int`，默认 1。`0` = Sobol 准随机序列，`1` = Uniform 均匀随机。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:58
#: 78a642aa56df4d1fb1db97003decd3bc
msgid ""
"Sobol 在少量样本（< 100）时位移方向分布更均匀，各向同性更好；Uniform 更快，样本数 ≥ 100 后两者差异很小。如果你只跑 "
"20-50 个结构，建议用 Sobol；跑几百个以上，选哪个都行。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:60
#: fe8970cebae146cd994b9425b986fde2
msgid "Max Distance（max_distance）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:62
#: 1c47b125782a4712939a5e4e4fd88368
msgid "`float`，默认 0.3。每个原子的最大位移，单位 Å。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:64
#: 143f984c0c2047a897a2f538dbbfd6c4
msgid ""
"注意这不是应变百分比，也不是 Cartesian 分量分别的上限——就是一个原子最多被挪多远。室温下原子振动幅度约 0.05~0.1 Å，设 "
"0.15~0.3 Å 通常够用。体系含 H 等轻元素时，H 振幅天然更大，建议同时开启 `use_element_scaling`。设到 "
"0.3~0.5 Å 以上时，跑完务必抽查最近邻键长——这个量级已经可能拉断键了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:66
#: e1d6d5c7224f4ccbb3b917e1894d1b98
msgid "Max Num（max_num）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:68
#: ba4fd0901921423f874bb3c86de08aec
msgid "`int`，默认 50。每个输入结构生成多少个扰动版本。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:70
#: b38b620667914efc9b119163f021da7e
msgid ""
"不是原子数上限——是输出结构的数量。20~50 适合轻量补样；50~100 常规覆盖；100+ 建议后面接一张 `FPS Filter` "
"去重，否则很多扰动样本在描述符空间里高度重复。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:72
#: 18137bb4edff4d9ca839a3c988810db6
msgid "Identify Organic（identify_organic）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:74
#: 22ad6913a6214edda99fe1327a9dfff7
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后把有机分子识别为刚性团簇，整个分子一起平移，分子内部键长完全保留。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:76
#: 7835db2e29f5496ea96846525b795425
msgid "你的体系是纯无机的（金属、氧化物、半导体）→ 关着就行，开了反而多算一堆团簇检测。体系含有机分子 → 必须开，否则每个原子独立随机位移会把分子撕碎。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:78
#: edf70278638541ce85e1abebe4512ed8
msgid "Use Element Scaling（use_element_scaling）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:80
#: 2d483164448445f0baafaae1b957918f
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后不同元素可以用不同的位移幅度，覆盖全局的 `max_distance`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:82
#: 7c0a4e62b2104643a82419c53eb81a3b
msgid ""
"多元素体系（比如含 H + 重元素）建议开。H 在室温下的振动幅度远大于重元素，用同一个 `max_distance` 会导致要么 H "
"位移太小、要么重元素位移太大。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:84
#: 8c7c5c951cfc4c87a4da5522405e20a8
msgid "Element Scalings（element_scalings）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:86
#: 0c5a21a48a2545f5a03ded41c9e43694
msgid "`dict[str, float] | None`，默认 None。元素 → 最大位移的映射。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:88
#: c604834030034d63bdf10b0869209491
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"格式如 `{\"H\": 0.5, \"O\": 0.15, \"Si\": 0.1}`。只对列出的元素生效，没列出的元素仍然用上面的 "
"`max_distance`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:90
#: 7ba77e4bb4584ba38f8afd5b388843a6
msgid "生效条件：`use_element_scaling` 必须为 true。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:92
#: a012c8af81144e839ed806175bfdfafa
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:94
#: bef7abd825fc420c816022f152c4eb20
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后每次跑同一输入 + 同一参数 + 同一 seed → 完全相同的扰动结果。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:96
#: 25cc2405c62245ea8358da4c3768a5f4
msgid "对比实验或者需要复现时打开，纯探索阶段可以关着。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:98
#: 43b545ff46f446d7af7eb4af5efe4577
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:100
#: e74dbf6557964ab7b3bf48650aa60f57
msgid "`int`，默认 0。随机种子值。仅在 `use_seed` 打开时生效。两个不同的 seed 会产生两组不同的位移分布。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:102
#: 8cfe54ef615940478006620291c55c7a
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:104
#: 1521b329d47741aba4414356cebfff6a
msgid "室温微扰（0.1 Å，Sobol，30 样本）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:105
#: fce0b593221d429b80409f1c3f55a7f0
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"PerturbCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"engine_type\": 0,\n"
"    \"max_distance\": 0.1,\n"
"    \"max_num\": 30,\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": false,\n"
"    \"use_element_scaling\": false,\n"
"    \"element_scalings\": {},\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:122
#: 3ad9e1f4402c4b6eafade647c9ed7c5d
msgid "常规补力场（0.2 Å，Uniform，50 样本）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:123
#: 22dc3c3034d64e2388c6025ba8638ab7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"PerturbCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"engine_type\": 1,\n"
"    \"max_distance\": 0.2,\n"
"    \"max_num\": 50,\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": false,\n"
"    \"use_element_scaling\": false,\n"
"    \"element_scalings\": {},\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:140
#: 619bc0f400a5403c9cfa8cff8a121b66
msgid "多元素差异化扰动（H 0.5 Å / 重元素 0.15 Å，100 样本）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:141
#: 2cc749c6d588460e914ca441635f3101
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"PerturbCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"engine_type\": 0,\n"
"    \"max_distance\": 0.15,\n"
"    \"max_num\": 100,\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": false,\n"
"    \"use_element_scaling\": true,\n"
"    \"element_scalings\": {\"H\": 0.5, \"C\": 0.2, \"O\": 0.15},\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:158
#: e72d1bbb8671406f8bfd465d97148bf9
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:160
#: 45875533525041dcbbb50b2210c40cf3
msgid "`Lattice Strain` → `Atomic Perturb`：先做全局形变，再补局部位移"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:161
#: 1c00d615cd51404881f0e6352d072807
msgid "`Shear Matrix Strain` → `Atomic Perturb`：剪切变形后加坐标噪声"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:162
#: 05c5e909c9ef45029bd638a5e335e3f6
msgid "`Atomic Perturb` → `FPS Filter`：大批量扰动后去重"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:164
#: c34c679510e44344a852af5d1524811c
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:166
#: 6aa94cf191eb43608ad9434cb69495d4
msgid ""
"**扰动后出现异常短键（< 1.0 Å）。** 两个相邻原子随机位移方向恰好相反，距离骤减。降低 `max_distance` 或增大 "
"`max_num` 后通过 `FPS Filter` 筛掉短键结构。这是随机扰动的固有局限——它不做碰撞检测。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:168
#: 8014e3f53d3649ed8ef386ac949de94e
msgid "**分子晶体中分子碎掉了。** `identify_organic` 没开。开启后整个分子团簇做刚性平移，分子内键长完全保留。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:170
#: 7189a0c603e144089c1de9437463c5de
msgid ""
"**扰动后力 MAE 没改善。** 可能 `max_distance` 太小，位移落在模型已经学好的线性区内。增大到 0.3~0.5 Å "
"试试。也可能体系本身的势能面非谐性很强，随机扰动方向不一定是最需要的——此时用 `Vib Mode Perturb` "
"替代，沿真实振动模方向做位移。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:172
#: 36f73b62505a40d6999a07d225de7b3d
msgid ""
"**Sobol 引擎 output 和预期不一致。** Sobol 序列的 scramble 受 seed 控制。如果 "
"`use_seed=false`，不同运行的 Sobol 序列也不同。需要可复现时必须 `use_seed=true`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:174
#: 8ea418ab1db44126b6b5f0207ccb3a61
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:176
#: c66472588c4743f2bc94382ebff6b552
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`Pert(d={max_distance},{U|S})` —— `U` 表示 Uniform，`S` 表示 Sobol。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:178
#: f419a29516104d08be8f90d2961a55ba
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:180
#: 7b27ce7fbaea48b6bb17911361546426
msgid "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。"
msgstr ""
